    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Navigate diverse paths</strong> filled with random encounters and unique challenges, making strategic decisions to overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruit and hire</strong> new party members, each with distinct skills, to complete your quests. Enhance your adventures by upgrading your characters' gear and equipment. Stock up on potions, collect precious gems, and gather gold to aid your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/1f0081bedad05f0cb8268d885586bfd1.poster.avif?t=1753731069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/1f0081bedad05f0cb8268d885586bfd1.webm?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/1f0081bedad05f0cb8268d885586bfd1.mp4?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead a roster of various unique characters, each with distinct abilities and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your heroes\u2019 stats to make them stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face dangerous events, circumstances, and quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the mystery surrounding the town of Westwall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in strategic, turn-based combat on a hex grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dynamic battles where characters\u2019 unique traits can unexpectedly shift the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a rich, atmospheric dark fantasy world with six distinct environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy roguelike features, including permadeath, for high-stakes gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated maps for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace traditional RPG elements like looting, inventory management, character leveling, stat upgrades, and customizable weapons and armor. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready yourself, adventurer, for the indomitable challenges that await. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/fd24f6aa019400c6e0f607e454b5abfa.poster.avif?t=1753731069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/fd24f6aa019400c6e0f607e454b5abfa.webm?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/fd24f6aa019400c6e0f607e454b5abfa.mp4?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Navigate diverse paths</strong> filled with random encounters and unique challenges, making strategic decisions to overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recruit and hire</strong> new party members, each with distinct skills, to complete your quests. Enhance your adventures by upgrading your characters' gear and equipment. Stock up on potions, collect precious gems, and gather gold to aid your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/1f0081bedad05f0cb8268d885586bfd1.poster.avif?t=1753731069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/1f0081bedad05f0cb8268d885586bfd1.webm?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/1f0081bedad05f0cb8268d885586bfd1.mp4?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead a roster of various unique characters, each with distinct abilities and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your heroes\u2019 stats to make them stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face dangerous events, circumstances, and quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the mystery surrounding the town of Westwall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in strategic, turn-based combat on a hex grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dynamic battles where characters\u2019 unique traits can unexpectedly shift the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a rich, atmospheric dark fantasy world with six distinct environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy roguelike features, including permadeath, for high-stakes gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated maps for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace traditional RPG elements like looting, inventory management, character leveling, stat upgrades, and customizable weapons and armor. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready yourself, adventurer, for the indomitable challenges that await. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/fd24f6aa019400c6e0f607e454b5abfa.poster.avif?t=1753731069\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/fd24f6aa019400c6e0f607e454b5abfa.webm?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1403990/extras/fd24f6aa019400c6e0f607e454b5abfa.mp4?t=1753731069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
